  <!-- ============ HELLO / BIO PAGE (front of book) ============ -->
  <section class="bio" id="hello">
    <div class="bio-label">RedefiningRetirement.io</div>
    <h2>Hello!</h2>
    <div class="bio-photos">
      <img class="portrait" style="width:260px; height:auto; border-radius:0;" src="/images/gen-exit-journal-bio.jpg" alt="Corey Koehler, with his Class of '90 senior photo">
    </div>
    <div class="name">Corey Koehler</div>
    <p>Hey, I'm Corey Koehler (KAY-ler). Former foundry worker, mechanical draftsman, 80s latchkey kid — Class of '90. No business background, no entrepreneurial bone in my body, nothing that ever pointed toward "runs his own thing."</p>
    <p>And yet, over the last 20 years, I've found more than 20 different ways to get paid outside of a job. Some worked. A bunch didn't. This is the whole list, no filter.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ CASSETTE DIVIDER — slot 1 ============ -->
